{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Crit Happens!</i> </strong>is a<strong> dice-building, turn-based roguelike</strong>\u00a0where you get to <strong>customize</strong> your dice for each encounter! In <strong><i>Crit Happens!</i></strong> you'll <strong>roll</strong> your dice before attacking, choosing which dice to <strong>hold</strong> and which dice to <strong>re-roll</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737160/extras/TurnExampleGIFVideo.gif?t=1748280287\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finding new <strong>dice faces</strong> on your journey and crafting them onto your dice will allow you to apply <strong>special effects</strong> to your attacks! Upgrading your dice will be essential to conquering the dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737160/extras/DiceCraftingGIFVideo.gif?t=1748280287\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire powerful <strong>trinkets</strong> and <strong>relics</strong> as you travel through these dangerous lands, changing the way you think about each turn. Do you <strong>hold</strong> or do you <strong>roll</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737160/extras/TreasureGIFVideo.gif?t=1748280287\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 enemy types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ trinkets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 special dice faces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 unique event scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 boss fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 floor.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737160?t=1748280287","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737160/3e73b39d895c9128c47f637788556f087bc9ce69/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748280287","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737160/e1495971c6771ec59c794e956816f8d3f3703f70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748280287","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737160/e1495971c6771ec59c794e956816f8d3f3703f70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748280287","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Crit Happens!</i> </strong>is a<strong> dice-building, turn-based roguelike</strong>\u00a0where you get to <strong>customize</strong> your dice for each encounter! In <strong><i>Crit Happens!</i></strong> you'll <strong>roll</strong> your dice before attacking, choosing which dice to <strong>hold</strong> and which dice to <strong>re-roll</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737160/extras/TurnExampleGIFVideo.gif?t=1748280287\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finding new <strong>dice faces</strong> on your journey and crafting them onto your dice will allow you to apply <strong>special effects</strong> to your attacks! Upgrading your dice will be essential to conquering the dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737160/extras/DiceCraftingGIFVideo.gif?t=1748280287\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire powerful <strong>trinkets</strong> and <strong>relics</strong> as you travel through these dangerous lands, changing the way you think about each turn. Do you <strong>hold</strong> or do you <strong>roll</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737160/extras/TreasureGIFVideo.gif?t=1748280287\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 enemy types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ trinkets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 special dice faces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 unique event scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 boss fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 floor.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Studio Alone"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3711540","name":"Crit Happens!"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737160/d8f9e083b54768e0d937d2003b1c1fbfa36b4c4f/header.jpg?t=1748280287","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257144790,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144790/movie480.mp4?t=1748280152","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144790/movie_max.mp4?t=1748280152"},"name":"Crit Happens! Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257144790/2a300e9f3f30929ed3a8f5590e89e36c1f916d6f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748280152","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144790/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748280152","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144790/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748280152"}}],"name":"Crit Happens! Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 m380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong>